homelab-roundcube-invite (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: "Send Invite" Settings tab, calling homelab-invite
    via homelab-api's gateway with the session's own OAuth token. No
    database credential of its own. Requires homelab-roundcube >=
    0.1.17 (the instance_id/.bootstrapped marker this package's
    postinst checks for).

